<div class="calcpad-output">
 <!-- Section properties of a half circle: area, centroid offset, second moments of area and radii of gyration. -->
 <h1>Geometrical Properties of Half Circle</h1>
 <div style="max-width:120mm">
  <img alt="half-circle.png" class="side" src="Images/mechanics/sections/half-circle.png" style="height:112pt;"/>
 </div>
 <p>
  Diameter -
  <span class="eq">
